WEBVTT

00:00:03.277 --> 00:00:05.316
Vincent van Gogh <b>was</b> an artist.

00:00:07.721 --> 00:00:09.566
<b>Was</b> he Dutch or French?

00:00:11.885 --> 00:00:13.926
She <b>wasn’t</b> in class yesterday.

00:00:16.405 --> 00:00:19.393
The Beatles <b>were</b> famous in the 1960s.

00:00:21.866 --> 00:00:23.310
Where <b>were</b> you last night?

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:24.933
You <b>weren’t</b> at home